cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these artifacts, please cite the SyncCaps manuscript."
title: "SyncCaps: pairwise-synchronisation capsule readouts for video activity recognition"
abstract: >-
  Experiment package for the SyncCaps manuscript: model and training code,
  per-experiment configurations, materialised dataset splits, exact pair
  dictionaries, seed-level results, per-clip prediction dumps, statistical
  analyses and figure provenance.
type: software
authors:
